cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this protocol or software, please cite it as below."
title: "KIT Adaptive Preregistration"
abstract: >-
  A protocol for adaptive preregistration of simulations and research software, and kit_ap, a CLI that
  installs it into git repositories: predictions and pass criteria are fixed and tagged before any citable
  run, plan changes are logged with whether the outcome was known, and failures close a version rather
  than edit it.
type: software
